<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 01-JUL.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 01-JUL.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical depression 5e is only a minor threat to shipping about 550 miles south of the southern tip of Baja.  </p>
<p>The heavy rain has let up in Gujarat India. Flooding continues as the rivers slowly recede.  </p>
<p>There are no further statements at this time.</p>
</text>
